<title>USA: BellSouth Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>BellSouth Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATLANTA, Jan 23 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.64		    $0.57</p>
<p> Oper net		 $633,000		 $564,000</p>
<p> Revs		   $5,050,000	     $4,765,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  933,000		  933,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>Note - Excludes charges for workforce reductions in year ago period of $725 million or $0.73 per share. Including charges, total net loss $161 million in 1995 Q4 or $0.16 per share.  </p>
<p>			12 MONTHS</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $2.53		    $2.24</p>
<p> Oper net	     $2,520,000	     $2,227,000</p>
<p> Revs		  $19,040,000	    $17,886,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  934,000		  933,000</p>
<p>Note - Year excludes $344 million gain, $0.35 per share on the sale of paging business and in 1995 $3.5 billion, $3.48 per share of charges, including non-cash charge for an accounting change. Including one-off items 1996 net was $2.86 billion, or $2.88 per share profit, compared with a $1.2 billion or $1.24 per share loss in all 1995.</p>
</text>
